      "Allocate exactly one aligned uint4 shared raw-weight cell per one of the 256 CTA threads, for 4096 bytes total.",
      "Issue the initial 16-byte cp.async.cg transfer and commit it.",
      "For each K64 stage, wait for the committed transfer, load that thread's uint4 from shared memory into registers, decode its E2M1 values with the unchanged E4M3FN scale codebook, then issue and commit the following stage's transfer only after the current uint4 is register-owned.",
